  "ownerDescription": "We are a Brazilian Jiu Jitsu Academy located on the 2nd Floor of Ruamchok Mall.\n\nSchedule\nMonday 6pm No Gi Fundamentals\nTuesday 6pm Gi BJJ Fundamentals\nThursday 6pm No Gi Fundamentals\nSunday 5pm No Gi All Level\n\nContact\nkaizenjiujitsuthai@gmail.com\n\nApproach\nWe attempt to practice Jiu Jitsu in accordance with the principle of Kaizen, continuous incremental improvement everyday.\n\nWe tend to focus on modern no-gi submission grappling techniques, strongly influenced by the techniques, training methods and philosophies of John Danaher.",
